# Mockups: runnable QML plus the screenshots taken from it, used to review a screen
# before touching the real one. The 5.7.0 set was deleted after that release and was
# never committed, so it is gone. The rule stays so the NEXT set lands outside the repo
# too: it is one release worth of scratch, not something a clone needs.
mockups/

# A jom build log that was captured by hand. Regenerated by any build, useful to keep
# locally while chasing a compile error, useless to everyone else.
# Untracked from the index on 09/09/2026 with git rm --cached, so this rule now
# actually bites; the file itself is still on disk.
scripts/build_output.txt
